DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261110T093000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261110T123000
SUMMARY:Apertus for NGOs: Running and Deploying Switzerland’s Open-source
  LLM
LOCATION:EPFL AI Center Lounge\, Lausanne
DESCRIPTION:Hands-on morning for non-profit staff and researchers on deploy
 ing Apertus\, Switzerland’s fully open large language model\, on their o
 wn infrastructure or via a provider — with a Swiss non-profit case study
  and group exercises.\n\nOrganiser: Swiss AI Initiative (ETH Zurich\, EPFL
  & CSCS)\n\nDetails and registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/ap
 ertus-for-ngos-workshop-lausanne-2026/
URL:https://swissdataevents.ch/events/apertus-for-ngos-workshop-lausanne-20
 26/
SEQUENCE:0
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
