SUMMARY:OpenTech Connect 2026 — Day 2: BUILD
LOCATION:EPFL Innovation Park I\, Lausanne
DESCRIPTION:Hands-on second day of OpenTech Connect: workshops\, technical 
 deep dives and practical labs with speakers from LlamaIndex\, Skilder\, Sy
 nergix and IBM Research. Registration is separate from day one.\n\nOrganis
 er: Data\, Cloud and AI in Switzerland (with Big Data University and IBM R
 esearch)\n\nDetails and registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/op
 entech-connect-build-lausanne-2026/
