DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261201T163000
SUMMARY:Reshaping Information Research with AI
LOCATION:EPFL\, room MED 0 1618\, Lausanne
DESCRIPTION:Two-hour on-site workshop from the EPFL Library comparing four 
 AI-powered research assistants\, how they work and where they differ from 
 traditional information retrieval. Open to the public\, registration requi
 red.\n\nOrganiser: EPFL Library\n\nDetails and registration: https://swiss
 dataevents.ch/events/epfl-reshaping-information-research-with-ai-2026/
